  - Install Config Pull Secret: https://console.redhat.com/openshift/install/pull-secret
  - Red Hat OpenShift Network Calculator: https://access.redhat.com/labs/ocpnc/
'
bl64_msg_show_batch_finish $? "$BL64_SCRIPT_ID"
